WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,960
You said earlier that I have almost eaten all the food I have stored at home.

2
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:05,080
Look at the steak I just saw this morning

3
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:07,430
Such cold weather

4
00:00:07,430 --> 00:00:09,630
Zhang Yi is still wearing thin pajamas

5
00:00:09,630 --> 00:00:11,470
Eating steak comfortably there

6
00:00:11,470 --> 00:00:12,470
drinking red wine

7
00:00:12,470 --> 00:00:14,910
Obviously everyone lives in the same unit

8
00:00:14,910 --> 00:00:17,850
Why does it feel like I’m living in two worlds?

9
00:00:17,850 --> 00:00:19,530
I'm dying to move now

10
00:00:19,530 --> 00:00:21,810
But Zhang Yi lived so comfortably

11
00:00:21,810 --> 00:00:26,220
So good

12
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:29,020
I also want to eat steak and red wine.

13
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:33,620
It's obvious enough that I'm hinting like this, right?

14
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:35,500
According to Zhang Yi’s character

15
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:39,830
At this time, I will definitely bring you steak and red wine.

16
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:46,490
You still think of me as the sweet dog you used to be?

17
00:00:46,490 --> 00:00:49,620
If you want to eat, go to the supermarket and buy it?

18
00:00:49,620 --> 00:00:51,500
It's minus sixty or seventy degrees outside

19
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:53,420
Now any inch of skin is exposed

20
00:00:53,420 --> 00:00:58,280
There is a possibility of injury, Zhang Yi

21
00:00:58,280 --> 00:00:59,940
You are really not a man

22
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:01,060
Give you such a good opportunity

23
00:01:01,060 --> 00:01:02,900
You don’t even know how to come over and show off?
